WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Hi, I'm Alex Rivera, I work at Stripe on the payments API team.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.200
Nice to meet you. I'm building a conference memory app with a graph database.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.900
Oh cool, we've been looking at graph databases for fraud detection, mostly multi-hop queries.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.000
We're actually hiring backend engineers in San Francisco, you should apply.

5
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.000
I'd love that. Could you send me the job link? I'll send you my demo after the event.

6
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.000
Sure, connect with me on LinkedIn and I'll send it tonight.

7
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.800
Hey, I'm Maya Chen, I'm a product manager at Notion.

8
00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:15.600
Hi Maya. What brings you to the hackathon?

9
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:22.400
I'm judging, and I'm interested in AI agents that remember context across sessions.

10
00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:28.300
That's exactly what my project does. It keeps a graph memory of people and talks.

11
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:33.000
Nice. I'm also mentoring early-career PMs if you know anyone who needs help.

12
00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.500
Good to know. I'll introduce you to a friend who's switching into product.
